   "type": "text",
   "x": 60,
   "y": 1445,
   "strokeColor": "#868e96",
   "roughness": 0,
   "text": "Subnets: cidrsubnet(10.0.0.0/16, 3, i) \u2192 four /19s. One NAT gateway: tasks in AZ b egress via AZ a. Interface endpoints are skipped while outbound access is on (NAT carries the traffic). CLOUDFRONT_VPC_ORIGIN=true (default).\nSource: modules/base/network.tf, vpc-endpoints.tf, modules/ecs/security-groups.tf \u00b7 drawn 2026-10-22",
   "fontSize": 12,
